        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "The fields subsystem constructs deformation functions for geometry and animation. Apply maps in a documented order; function composition is generally non-commutative. Track whether a function returns an absolute point or a displacement. A custom mapping must preserve finite coordinates and receive adequate subdivision to show curvature."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Exact contracts: [Field](/api-math-fields#standardfields), [SubdivisionEngine](/api-utils#subdivisionengine)."
        }
